  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Cut four pieces of parchment paper into large squares.",
    "Place a fish fillet in the center of each square.",
    "Sprinkle herbal spice mix, lemon juice, garlic, and paprika over the fish.",
    "Fold the parchment paper over the fish to form a pouch, and seal by folding the edges.",
    "Place the pouches on a baking sheet, and bake for 12-15 minutes.",
    "Check for doneness by flaking the fish with a fork.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped parsley."
